{"sba-nogi-48974":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n \n 今日は\n 17:30〜のぎおびshowroom配信\n 23:45〜文化放送レコメンです✨✨\n \n #レコメン女心 つぶやいてね\n \n よろしくです o(^-^)o\n \n \n \n だいたい全部展のパーカー☺︎\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF98PN02FXH90S62935NHF2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n Lサイズでだぼっと着ました。\n \n 白は今は売り切れみたいですが\n 黒を着たらあすかとお揃いですよ〜\n ぜひともぜひとも\n \n 逃げ水の個人tシャツもかわいいので\n 要checkです☺︎\n 個人的にはバレッタのタオルがすきです\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF98QPXTXE350B48GXVCZ95","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 乃木中見てくださいましたか？\n \n 見事に真っ黒。笑\n 羽子板をやるのは小さい頃以来で\n 楽しかったです✨\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF98RSWYT2607QEEJ1MHYP4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF98SXNV0E4NWBC4YW0AZZY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n 眠れる森の美女のオーロラ姫が\n \n 私の中でシンデレラと並ぶくらいに\n リスペクトしているディズニープリンセスで、\n オーロラ姫風の\n 黒カチューシャ×巻き下ろしは\n 最近のお気に入りへアです☺︎\n \n フランスのユッセ城にいつか行きたいな〜って\n 思います\n お姫様は女の子の永遠の憧れだし\n いつか白馬の王子様が現れると夢見てます...\n \n \n でもカメラを向けられると変顔をするあたり\n まだまだですな...\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF98TZ4DTKHEFX2VAXJKVC2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ひよこ\n \n \n \n \n \n では。\n \n "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-41064":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n \n \n こんにちは‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RAGRRSDCVFYRRAJ4XN8Y0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 広島〜😊\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 広島公演に来てくださったみなさん、ありがとうございました！！まだまだツアーは続くのでみなさん、待っててくださいね🥰\n \n \n \n \n \n そして昨日はまなふぃのお誕生日でした😊\n \n 本人曰くまなふぃって書くらしいけど、私の中ではまなふぃーって伸ばす棒がつきます😆\n \n \n \n \n お誕生日おめでとう🎉\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3RAHT4YGTAAHWTTJVZ80KD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 綺麗なお姉さん💜\n \n らぶ。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてそして、6枚目シングル「ってか」のミーグリの受付が始まっているんですが。\n \n 2次で完売することが出来ました！！\n \n ありがとうございます😊とっても嬉しいです。\n \n \n \n \n 皆さんに会えることを楽しみに待っています😘✌🏻\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-20753":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログ、ご協力\nありがとうございましたっ！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふむふむ。\nみんなが気になってることは\nわりと一致してるんだなあ！\nふむふむ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルプラネットさんに\n取材していただいた記事が\n公開されています(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://idol-planet.com/premium/201410/09-nogizaka46-4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろーんな質問に\n細かく答えています(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆらりかりヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10.10 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻水さん\nもーりーさん\nさかさまの半分さん\nたんだむさん\nくみこさん・満さん\nあすみさん\n上ちゃん上ちゃんかれんちゃん\nオスベリハイタウンさん\nい  ま  り  んさん\nしんちゃんさん\nターザンさん\nまなちゃむさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日誕生日の人、多っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 10月23日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ明日から三日間\n1日2公演＼(^o^)／\n楽しみがんばる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ短くてごめんね(๑°︿°๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/10/5022362/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-12754":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は火曜サプライズに出演してきました！\n見てくださった方ありがとうございました！\n生放送緊張したー(°_°)\n緊張しすぎて言う事間違えたりしました！\nきゃーきゃー。・゜・(ノД`)・゜・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだテレビ慣れません！\nいろいろ勉強していかねばね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/02/7534352/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーさんは最近人の帽子かぶるの好きなんだって！\n今日いこま帽子かぶってきてね。\n写真とろー！\nって言ったらずーさんいつの間にかかぶってた！\nそんなずーさんの行動が可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/02/7534352/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n今日からNOGIBINGO！始まりますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも見てちょーだい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね\nいこま最近髪のびたのね〜\nと言ってもまだまだショートだけどっ！\nだからちとのばしてみようと思うの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどう思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこま夢があって地毛で銀魂の神楽ちゃんみたいなお団子してみたいの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり時間かかりそー！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}}